    <notes>INFO (course setter to include on map)
Title: Lincoln University
Scale: 1:4,000
Contour interval: N/A
North lines: 150m apart


CREDITS (course setter to include on map - 6pt Arial)
Cartography: M. Wood L. Earnshaw 2008
Updates: N. Hann 2015, N. Smith 2018, S. Smith 2023, J. Lynch 2025
Copyright © Peninsula and Plains Orienteers
Possession of this map does not imply right of access
Non-commercial use only unless otherwise granted
Map version: d44e8ce


COORDINATORS' NOTES (map coordinator to update + commit on map being sent)
Last sent to: Joseph Lynch &lt;joegoodwinlynch@gmail.com&gt;


CONTROLLERS' NOTES (controller to read upon map being sent)
Note from University staff that residential areas (west half campus) would generally be unavailable for events held between Feb and November.
LU have indicated major construction circa 2027.
Contact for map access - Katherine Baxendale (LU Sport Coordinator, Katherine.Baxendale@lincoln.ac.nz)


MAPPERS' NOTES
George Forbes building requires updates - mapped very roughly April 2025</notes>
